{"title": "The Watch (faction)", "pageid": 47230, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Watch_(faction)", "categories": ["Factions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This page is for the Watch faction. For the class action that summons allies, see <a href=\"/wiki/The_Watch_(class_action)\" title=\"The Watch (class action)\">The Watch (class action)</a>, and for the Steel Watch, see the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watcher</a>.</div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png/200px-Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png/300px-Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/1e/Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png/200px-Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Item_ARM_Helmet_BG_Watch_Metal_B.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Helmet of the Watch</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>The Watch</b> is the civil constabulary of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>, responsible for law enforcement within the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City\" title=\"Upper City\">Upper City</a> and the protection of its citizens.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span></h2>\n<p>Well-armed, equipped, and trained, the <b>City Watch</b> (also referred to as <b>Watchers</b> and <b>Watchmen</b>) projected their authority in the Upper City from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Watch_Citadel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watch Citadel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Watch_Citadel\">Watch Citadel</a></span> located within the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Streets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Citadel Streets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Citadel_Streets\">Citadel Streets</a></span> districts, where they train and are headquartered at. The responsibilities of a Watcher comprised of regular patrols, maintaining curfews and clearing people from the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Wide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wide\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Wide\">Wide</a></span> upon dusk, as well as identifying and monitoring non-citizens of the Upper City through numbered badges that were given to guests of Upper City residents.\n</p><p>Watchmen took pride in their organisation, were said to be incorruptible, and were expected to protect the Upper City and <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> at all costs should the need arise.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>The Watch remains largely unconnected to the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute crisis</a> until the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a> breaks through the Upper City, taking its place atop <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/High_Hall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"High Hall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/High_Hall\">High Hall</a></span>. A sizeable and diverse force of Absolutist cultists, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Inquisitor_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Inquisitor of the Absolute\">inquisitors</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Zealot_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Zealot of the Absolute\">zealots</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin\" title=\"Goblin\">goblins</a> would emerge from the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City_Sewers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upper City Sewers\">Upper City Sewers</a> underneath High Hall, and supported by <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayers</a> and undead, would wrestle control of High Hall from the Watch.\n</p><p>Over the course of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confront the Elder Brain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Confront the Elder Brain</a>, most of the City Watch present at High Hall and the Watch Citadel have been eradicated and routed from the premises by the Absolute's forces, with a large concentration of Watch bodies strewn all over the area. Nevertheless, the Watch Citadel would still become the meeting point for the party's allies in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\">Gather Your Allies</a>, where <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/20px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/30px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/40px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valeria\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png/20px-Portrait_Valeria.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Valeria.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Valeria\" title=\"Valeria\">Valeria</a> can be present and mention that the remnants of the Watch are ready to fight back.\n</p><p>Climbing the steps to High Hall would have the party encounter a six-person squad of Watchmen fleeing from the battle, with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Matthew\" title=\"Matthew\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Portrait_Matthew.png/20px-Portrait_Matthew.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Portrait_Matthew.png/30px-Portrait_Matthew.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Portrait_Matthew.png/40px-Portrait_Matthew.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Matthew\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Portrait_Matthew.png/20px-Portrait_Matthew.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Portrait_Matthew.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Matthew\" title=\"Matthew\">Watchman Matthew</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Preyn\" title=\"Preyn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Preyn.png/20px-Portrait_Preyn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Preyn.png/30px-Portrait_Preyn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Preyn.png/40px-Portrait_Preyn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Preyn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Preyn.png/20px-Portrait_Preyn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Preyn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Preyn\" title=\"Preyn\">Watchman Preyn</a> perishing from a Mind Flayer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Blast\" title=\"Mind Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Blast\" title=\"Mind Blast\">Mind Blast</a> before the party can intervene. The party can then convince <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gyordi\" title=\"Gyordi\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_Gyordi.png/20px-Portrait_Gyordi.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_Gyordi.png/30px-Portrait_Gyordi.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_Gyordi.png/40px-Portrait_Gyordi.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Gyordi\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_Gyordi.png/20px-Portrait_Gyordi.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Portrait_Gyordi.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gyordi\" title=\"Gyordi\">Watchman Gyordi</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Goodge\" title=\"Goodge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Goodge.png/20px-Portrait_Goodge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Goodge.png/30px-Portrait_Goodge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Goodge.png/40px-Portrait_Goodge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Goodge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Portrait_Goodge.png/20px-Portrait_Goodge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Portrait_Goodge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Goodge\" title=\"Goodge\">Watchman Goodge</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ebber\" title=\"Ebber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Ebber.png/20px-Portrait_Ebber.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Ebber.png/30px-Portrait_Ebber.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Ebber.png/40px-Portrait_Ebber.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Ebber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Ebber.png/20px-Portrait_Ebber.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Ebber.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ebber\" title=\"Ebber\">Watchman Ebber</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fry\" title=\"Fry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Fry.png/20px-Portrait_Fry.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Fry.png/30px-Portrait_Fry.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Fry.png/40px-Portrait_Fry.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watchman Fry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Fry.png/20px-Portrait_Fry.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Fry.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fry\" title=\"Fry\">Watchman Fry</a> to stand their ground and fight as allies through a DC 20 <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> check. Similarly, a squad of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Guardian\" title=\"Watcher Guardian\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png/20px-Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png/30px-Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png/40px-Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Watcher Guardians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png/20px-Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Watcher_Guardian.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Guardian\" title=\"Watcher Guardian\">Watcher Guardians</a> can be summoned by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/38px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/50px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\">Gather Your Allies</a> action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Watch\" title=\"The Watch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Watch_Icon.webp/25px-The_Watch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Watch_Icon.webp/38px-The_Watch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Watch_Icon.webp/50px-The_Watch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Watch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/The_Watch_Icon.webp/25px-The_Watch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/The_Watch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Watch\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Watch\">The Watch</a> to fight on the party's side.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Members\">Members</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><